{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and defend your dungeon in a strategic roguelite tower defense with board-game mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your troops, place traps and special rooms, and withstand relentless waves of enemies eager to overthrow your reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Choose Your Lord!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lords are the heart of <i>Kings Origin</i>: a vibrant cast of more than six characters, each with unique abilities, personalities, and motivations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight head-on with your Lord on the frontlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a labyrinth filled with traps and deceptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or empower your minions to defend your domain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every strategy is viable. How far will your ambition take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6\u00a0Create Your Own Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your destiny day by day with decisions that change every run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching paths</strong> with battles, events, or ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate cards</strong> that define your daily choices: fight, surprise, or reward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique relics</strong> and hidden secrets that transform your tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful planning is key: one misplaced room or trap could be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 CONTENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ <strong>Lords</strong> with special abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of <strong>units, heroes, and beasts</strong> to command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable traps and rooms</strong> for your dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events</strong> filled with twists and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious relics</strong> that change every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaprogression</strong> to unlock permanent upgrades and expand your reign.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule with cunning, forge an unbreakable defense, and let your dungeon thrive in a world where only the sharpest minds survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/5600fd2f2864f316ba0e1aed86ce2ff1bb158f51.jpg"},{"name":"Twenty-Day Vigil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/6c583bf370944bb548c62fe8b9c9ed15ef0d2d12.jpg"},{"name":"Command the Cid Campeador","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/e02fdb2df57ab97c463e8c2eaaefb715dbc0de8a.jpg"},{"name":"The Campeador's Feat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/aaa46f9bbb9fec238232032989525f0484bd3e91.jpg"},{"name":"Foundry of Troops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/9bb9dc86c4f8a5d8a6bd2395e1995e64eea600d0.jpg"},{"name":"Roots Revealed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/0d873ef99e1aee6e76e2854e5334d990c0df6845.jpg"},{"name":"Roadside Surprise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/d73c49b10181abf9706d3152811b05d583ef3967.jpg"},{"name":"Forty-Night Trial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2907320/58ab9eb734e3c529b3c0b